# Tailwind v4 design tokens

Source of truth: `packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css`. No `tailwind.config.js` theme keys. No `@utility` for tokens.

## Layers

Both `@theme` and `@theme inline` emit CSS variables. The difference is the **utility**: `@theme` uses `var(--token)`; `@theme inline` copies the value into the class.

- **`@theme inline` (pointers only)**: `--color-*` → `var(--primary)` etc. Fonts → `var(--font-*-family)`. So `bg-primary` is `var(--primary)` on the element, not a wrapper resolved at `:root`.
- **`@theme` (overridable values)**: spacing, radius, `--shadow-card`, display type, `--container-*`. Utilities follow later overrides (`48rem` / `64rem` spacing + `--radius`; `.dark { --shadow-card }`).
- **Colors**: oklch on `:root` / `.dark` (`--primary`). Never `--color-primary: var(--primary)` in `@theme` (not inline).
- **Spacing + radius (B)**: t-shirt / scale in `@theme`. Override the **same** variable at `48rem` and `64rem`. No `clamp()` on padding or radius. Do not put spacing in `@theme inline` (`p-sm` would bake `0.75rem`).
- **Display type (A)**: `--text-display` / `--text-title` use `clamp()`. Do not clamp `text-sm` / `text-xs`.
- **Shadows**: `--shadow-card` in `@theme` (inset `var(--card-specular)`). Dark mode may retarget `--shadow-card`.
- **Fonts**: `@theme inline` maps `--font-sans` and `--font-display` to `--font-*-family` from `next/font`. Use `font-sans` / `font-display` in components—not `font-montserrat` / `font-righteous`.

Never `--font-sans: var(--font-sans)` or `--shadow-card: var(--card-shadow)`.

## Spacing (t-shirt only)

`xxs` 4 · `xs` 8 · `sm` 12→16 · `md` 16→20 · `lg` 20→24 · `xl` 24→32 · `2xl` 32→40 · `3xl` 48.

`p-sm` / `gap-md` / `px-xl` once — not `md:p-md`. Product UI uses t-shirt spacing only (`p-sm`, `gap-md`, `px-xl`). Do not use numeric spacing utilities (`p-4`, `px-2`, `gap-3`, `mt-6`, `w-10`, etc.) in `apps/web` or `packages/ui` components.

Do **not** add semantic spacing (`page`, `section`, `stack`, `gutter`, `inline`, `p-card`). Card padding is `p-md` / `--spacing-md`. Header uses `p-sm`.

`--spacing-xl` also generates `max-w-xl` (small). Never use `max-w-sm|md|xl` for layout.

## Widths (`--container-*`)

| Token | Class | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--container-content` | `max-w-content` | Main column 64rem |
| `--container-form` | `max-w-form` | Auth 36rem |
| `--container-dialog` | `max-w-dialog` | Dialogs 28rem |
| `--container-narrow` | `max-w-narrow` | Empty/error 20rem |

## Radius (B)

Step `--radius` 8→10→12px so `rounded-sm` … `rounded-4xl` grow together.

- `rounded-card` → `--radius-4xl`
- `rounded-panel` → `--radius-3xl`
- `rounded-full` is static

Do not also override `--radius-card` in media queries.

## Shadows

`shadow-card` on cards and the sticky header. Do not invent a second card shadow name.
